Subject: Fix stale iterators during svg resource cycle check
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Fixed: 569038297
Change-Id: I62c94483506a992005d71673eff044202b9a784c
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8516494
